"releaseNotes":"Welcome to Blood Pressure Log for Omron — now your readings can follow the guideline your own doctor uses.\n• The PDF report you bring to your doctor is now built on the scale you chose: the same thresholds, the same zones, the same names your doctor works with\n• Choose the standard your readings are measured against — American, European, ESC or Chinese — in Settings → Blood Pressure Scale\n• Your numbers stay exactly as they were; only the name of the zone changes, so it matches the wording your doctor uses\n• You may notice that wording is new: a reading once called \"High\" now reads \"Stage 1\" — the same measurement, described the way guidelines describe it today\n• The app opens properly on Mac\n• Reminders come back on their own if you allow notifications later\n• Readings and weight still arrive from Apple Health when your phone was locked at the time they were taken\nThank you for staying with us. Please keep sharing your reviews on the App Store, and write to us from Settings → Support — your support code comes with the message, so we can find your case straight away.", "trackId":6761458473, "trackName":"Blood Pressure Log •", "price":0.00, "releaseDate":"2026-05-27T07:00:00Z", "minimumOsVersion":"18.0", "genreIds":["6013", "6020"], "primaryGenreName":"Health & Fitness", "primaryGenreId":6013, "sellerName":"Sergii Gavryliuk", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-09-07T07:36:47Z", "version":"1.0.7", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"My Blood Pressure Tracker + helps you stay consistent with your health routine by making blood pressure logging simple, clear, and reliable. Whether you track daily readings or review long-term trends, the app gives you everything you need in one place — now with smooth Omron integration for effortless data syncing.\n\nMAIN FEATURES\n — Simple BP Logging: Quickly add blood pressure, pulse, and heart rate entries. Keep all your data organized in a clean and easy-to-use logbook.\n — Omron Device Support: Connect with Omron monitors and sync your readings seamlessly to avoid manual input and keep your records accurate.\n — Smart Insights: Review your history and spot trends over time to better understand how your lifestyle impacts your blood pressure.\n — Reminders That Work for You: Set flexible notifications for logging entries, medications, or daily routines so you never miss a record.\n — Clear Charts & Export: View your data through simple graphs and export reports to share with healthcare professionals when needed.\n — Secure Backup: Your information is securely available across devices connected to your Apple ID.\n\nSubscription Details\n• Choose the subscription plan that works best for you: a weekly or annual subscription option. If you decide to cancel, you can do so quickly and conveniently through your iTunes settings.\n• Upon subscribing, payment will be charged to your iTunes account. Your subscription will automatically renew unless you disable auto-renewal at least 24 hours before the current period ends. Renewal charges will be applied within 24 hours prior to the conclusion of the current subscription period.\n• You can cancel your subscription anytime via your Account Settings without any cancellation fees. Additionally, your subscription is accessible across all devices linked to your Apple ID.\nAt our core, we aim to bring happiness and ease to people's lives by offering access to advanced technology. Our mission is to develop outstanding mobile applications for users striving to enhance their productivity and efficiency in daily life.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/my-blood-pressure-tracker/privacy-policy\nTerms of Service:  https://sites.google.com/view/my-blood-pressure-tracker/terms-of-service\nStandard Apple Terms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nFor any questions, feedback or assistance, please fill out the form — https://forms.gle/5ahNJMijzVBV1pnw6 \nStay on top of your routine with My Blood Pressure Tracker + — your everyday BP log with built-in Omron support.", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.18391000000000001790567694115452468395233154296875, "trackCensoredName":"Blood Pressure Log •", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/blood-pressure-log/id6761458473?uo=4", "genres":["Health & Fitness", "Medical"], "userRatingCount":174}]
